---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About ASTERWARD"
  description="ASTERWARD begins with market questions worth understanding and tests them with evidence from the United States, Taiwan, and Malaysia."
  lang="en"
  alternateUrl="/about/"
>
  <section class="site-shell archive-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">About ASTERWARD</p>
    <h1>ASTERWARD</h1>
    <p>ASTERWARD does not publish market summaries simply to fill a calendar. Each piece begins with a question I genuinely want to understand: what is the market pricing in, what might it be missing, and what evidence would change my mind?</p>
  </section>

  <section class="article-grid">
    <div class="article-body">
      <h2>Research scope</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>United States</li>
        <li>Taiwan</li>
        <li>Malaysia</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Research process</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Propose candidate topics worth investigating</li>
        <li>Turn that curiosity into a precise research question</li>
        <li>Test it with relevant price, fundamental, technical, and positioning evidence</li>
        <li>State the conclusion, alternative scenario, and explicit invalidation conditions</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Research principle</h2>
      <blockquote>Question → Evidence → Pricing → Scenario → Invalidation</blockquote>
      <p>I publish only when the evidence adds something useful to the question. ASTERWARD is independent market research and commentary, not investment advice.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
